---
const steps = [
  {
    title: "入口與停車",
    text: "提早抵達，優先選擇離主入口近、符合現場標線的停車位置。",
  },
  {
    title: "主要平順動線",
    text: "由主入口進入，沿鋪面或木棧步道前往無障礙觀景區，不走草坡捷徑。",
  },
  {
    title: "觀景與休息",
    text: "在平坦觀景區與座椅周邊停留，不必為了較高視野勉強進入階梯區。",
  },
  {
    title: "原路返回",
    text: "天色變暗前先辨認回程，沿同一條平順路線返回停車區。",
  },
];
---

<div class="not-prose my-8 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
  <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-amber-600">建議動線</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-ink">少走高差的四步安排</h2>
    </div>
    <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-paper px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-ink-soft sm:block">
      輪椅・推車・長者
    </span>
  </div>

  <ol class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
    {
      steps.map((step, index) => (
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl bg-paper p-4">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-night text-sm font-bold text-amber-cta">
            {index + 1}
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-ink">{step.title}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">{step.text}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>

  <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-amber-cta bg-amber-cta/10 p-4">
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">
      <strong>需要避開：</strong>草坡、階梯捷徑、雨後濕滑區與沒有照明的邊緣路段。輪椅使用者建議由同行者陪同。
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
